Z||000000||Fiero5||06-18-2000||11:30 PM||||The Twin State Cruisers will hold their 7th annual car show on August 19, 2000 from 9am to 3pm at Colburn Park, Lebanon NH. We are trying to get as many Fiero folks as possible to attend, as they have granted us our own class for Fiero's. I have a commitment of about 10 Fieros so far, with many more expected. Our Fiero class will be sponsored by Bob Parker and Kick Hill Farms of CT. After the show at 3pm or so, every Fiero lover is invited to caravan to our house after for a Fiero cookout at our place in Plainfield NH, about 15 minutes away from Lebanon. Anyone who wants to attend or who wants more info, e-mail me or call 603-675-9193. We hope to see you there. Sincerely, Steve Kelley and Family<BR>8 Fiero's and counting||||reg||1
